The Menu icon {6h} is in the top left hand corner. Click this icon to display a list a menu  functions.{\br}{\br}
    {0h} {7h} {\br}If you find yourself a little lost the Home menu entry will take you back to the beginning.{\br}{\br}
                             {2h} {8h} {\br}One way to explore is to use the Name Index which lists everyone, grouped by surname. Clicking on a person's name will bring up a page with their details.{\br}{\br}
    {3h} {9h} {\br}Similarly there is a Family Index.{\br}{\br}
    {1h} {10h} {\br}Perhaps the easiest way to get started is with the Family Tree diagrams. This menu item will list them. Click on a entry to display an interactive representation of a 'genogram' giving a graphical representation of a family tree.{\br}{\br}
    [{?4}{4h} {11h} {\br}Clicking this entry will display a Google map showing the locations associated with people in this report, but only for places where the author has provided latitude and longitude coordinates. {\br}{\br}The icon {5h} following the name on individual, family and place pages will show map of locations associated with that individual, family or place.]

